; caldera_sun_stair.room - the Sun Stair, the summer guardian's way home (WORLD-35, design 04 section 3.7): from caldera_arena's
; east doorway (rows 41-44) up to a vault under village_gate_east's road, whose grate opens once the summer guardian is restored.
; Base kit both ways, stone only: a spiral of shelves 3 rows apart - a wall step (L' cols 1-3, R' cols 16-18), then a wide shelf
; across (R cols 7-18, L cols 1-12). No shelf overhangs another's take-off edge within 6 rows, and every fall is 6 rows or less
; (bugs/a-redoma-first-player-is-trapped-in-the-summer-caldera; gotchas/zigzag-ledges-two-rows-apart-seal-a-shaft).
; Row 0: the vault's one-way plank (cols 9-14) 3 rows under the street hole (gate cols 29-32), one jump from the road; open over
; cols 1-8 under the gate's ground, so the hop onto the row-3 shelf has headroom. Verao Espacial 1 on the floor: Sombra holds the
; plate (col 9) six cells from the gate (col 15) of the shrine alcove (cols 16-18) and its reward slot.

